# The Quantum Technology Atlas deployed at https://qodeh.com/publications/quantum-technology-atlas/
#
# The deploy (.github/workflows/deploy-aws.yml) checks out qraveh/qt-map at ATLAS_SHA, builds it
# (python build/build.py — byte-reproducible on Linux / CPython 3.12, qt-map's own CI proves it),
# refuses to go on unless dist/ATLAS_MAIN hashes to ATLAS_DIST_SHA256, and assembles the tree under
# public/. Its record pages (1,212 in three languages, ~37 MB) are in git on neither side; the pictures are in
# static/publications/quantum-technology-atlas/media/ (the files named in the build's
# dist/media-files.txt, from the media register's assets/thumbs/).
#
# To deploy a new Atlas revision: set the three values from the hand-off's ACCEPTANCE block (after
# reproducing it locally), refresh media/ if media-files.txt changed, commit, push.
ATLAS_SHA=ca7e9a71aadf216ad038695ea07e800df863a525
ATLAS_MAIN=Quantum-Technology-Atlas-2026.09.html
ATLAS_DIST_SHA256=39d4aecec02d71e3a99407944e30da51a41b129a8b978b47f8716de3bb386edb
